        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-primary font-bold">•</span>
          <span><strong>Bilateral DTA Credit:</strong> Claim Section 132/133 foreign tax credits to legally eliminate double taxation on the same income.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-primary font-bold">•</span>
          <span><strong>Interactive Calculator:</strong> Estimate your FSI tax liability instantly via our <a href="/countries/malaysia/foreign-income/foreign-income-calculator/" class="text-link font-semibold hover:underline">Malaysia Foreign Income Calculator</a>.</span>
        </li>
